@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Corpo ausente no check-in → esperado: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/acessos/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Código QR vazio → esperado: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/acessos/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigoQr": ""
}

### Código QR inexistente → esperado: 404 Not Found
POST {{baseUrl}}/acessos/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigoQr": "codigo-inexistente"
}
